1
00:00:00,592 --> 00:00:03,575
As Uke comes round to grab both shoulders 
from behind

2
00:00:03,576 --> 00:00:04,581
lead him towards you

3
00:00:04,982 --> 00:00:07,134
as he comes round for the second shoulder

4
00:00:07,135 --> 00:00:10,966
move forward slightly and drop down 
so Uke comes completely passed you,

5
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:12,868
move back controlling his wrist

6
00:00:12,869 --> 00:00:15,686
take the bottom arm cutting across his top elbow

7
00:00:15,687 --> 00:00:17,861
extend forward and down into the throw.

